mctrace 1
profile 1
precision f32
tick 1 time 41800000 dt 00000000
action 40a site 0 args 0 result nil
tick 2 time 42000000 dt 41800000
action 40a site 0 args 0 result string "hi"
port radio send group 0 string "hi"
action 408 site 2 args 3 string "hi" nil nil result void
tick 3 time 42400000 dt 41800000
action 40a site 0 args 0 result nil
